From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OE3ANC <dev@oe3anc.at>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 11:30:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] compulab-imx93: boot from eMMC first, skip USB

LinHT boots from eMMC, with a backup SD card on the SD2 test points.
Try eMMC first and SD as fallback, and drop usb_ul: "usb start" scans
the bus on every boot although LinHT never boots from USB.

Signed-off-by: OE3ANC <dev@oe3anc.at>
---
 include/configs/compulab-imx93.h | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

--- a/include/configs/compulab-imx93.h
+++ b/include/configs/compulab-imx93.h
@@ -165,7 +165,7 @@
 				    "true;" \
 				"fi;" \
 			"fi;\0" \
-		"bootlist=sd_ul usb_ul emmc_ul\0" \
+		"bootlist=emmc_ul sd_ul\0" \
 	"bsp_bootcmd=echo Running BSP bootcmd ...; " \
 		"for src in ${bootlist}; do " \
 			"run ${src}; " \
